WEBVTT

00:08:59.285 --> 00:09:04.206
And what I realize is that intellectually
I had grown and evolved,

00:09:04.206 --> 00:09:06.542
but emotionally ...

00:09:06.542 --> 00:09:08.419
I was Tom Petty

00:09:08.419 --> 00:09:10.588
and I was living in “Petticoat Junction.”

00:09:10.754 --> 00:09:11.755
(Laughter)

00:09:12.089 --> 00:09:15.092
I told y’all that brown
doesn’t look good on me;

00:09:15.092 --> 00:09:17.052
petty looks even worse.

00:09:17.386 --> 00:09:18.721
It’s not my shade.

00:09:19.888 --> 00:09:23.767
And so what I wound up
having to do was really get a grip.

00:09:24.893 --> 00:09:27.396
I had to assess a few things about myself,

00:09:27.396 --> 00:09:30.608
and I decided to do
a little self-help ritual called ...